            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EInsurance (including Covid cover) \u00A392\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESingle room supplement for a Premium Room \u00A3299\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDeluxe Room supplement (please refer to the booking form for the cost of staying in this particular room type)\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDinners on Days 2, 3 \u0026amp; 4\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELunches\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
